{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>To freedom he shall send him.</b> Midrash — and therefore a Canaanite slave goes free with a tooth and an eye. The Holy One, blessed be He, said: Cham saw his father's nakedness and told his brothers with his mouth; therefore he was cursed to be a servant to his brothers. And this one offended with his eyes or with his teeth; therefore he goes free through them to freedom."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:03:44.303210231Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}